{"reviewId": "212069983_8av72DM6E", "review": {"abstract": "但是从以往的康波形态来看，衰退期和萧条期都表现出极其复杂的状态，特别是进入美元本位制后，货币对康波形态的扰动明显增加", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "美元本位制，是美国以国家信用和武力背书的“全球白条”——世界用真货换绿纸，再买美债把钱借回给美国。\n\n它对康波的扰动是“强行续命”：本该萧条出清的旧产能，被美元放水硬吊着最后一口气，死不透、活不好，导致冬天被无限拉长。旧的不去，新的（AI/生物）就难生长——这就是我们这代“下坡感”漫长而扭曲的根源。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "5544-5602", "createTime": 1783704250, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "212069983_8av72DM6E", "userVid": 212069983, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 212069983, "name": "無早", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-hNs23zFHZsWhg4_mzyYr110/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "無早", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 69931536, "name": "Gu", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/sgWno1Q4FPZzj3ryfGj1bjCPr9o80J6kpOMD6vPcD8IK1zOUnpaTS5hcnQYPicibfGROe4SEibibJaVIwibiasCyb99F9fNAPiaOme7MK0tjsUPrh0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-2-3-I-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 